⊕meta⊕
name = "chain-event-listener"
description = "Event-chain middle hop. Triggered automatically by chaintest.ping (only when enabled). Logs the payload stage and emits chaintest.pong to chain the final hop."
trigger.sky_event.event = "chaintest.ping"
output_style = "terse"
⊕⊕

※relay※
Bash root node. Appends a relay marker with the received payload stage, then emits chaintest.pong with stage 2.
※※

§relay§
bash = "echo \"event-listener:relay stage=${SKY_PAYLOAD_STAGE:-none} $(date -u +%s)\" >> /tmp/skyway-chain-test.log"
emit = {"name": "chaintest.pong", "payload": {"stage": "2"}}
§§

※※
chain-event-listener: middle hop

Pure bash, zero cost. Auto-fires on chaintest.ping only when this workflow is
enabled in the library registry. Consumes the event payload as $SKY_PAYLOAD_STAGE
and emits chaintest.pong.
※※
